title: Confronting the Nazis
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: (nsdap_r >= 10 and nazi_urgency > 1) and confronting_nazis_timer == 0 and iron_front_formed == 0
on-arrival: confronting_nazis_seen += 1; confronting_nazis_timer = 5; month_actions += 1
card-image: img/iron_front.png
tags: party_affairs; antifascism

# Forming the Iron Front

The Nazis' strength is gaining, as shown by their recent election results and their violent presence in the streets. Their fascism threatens to plunge Germany once again into the abyss.

Many in our party are calling for urgent action. The "neorevisionist" faction, led by young socialists like Carlo Mierendorff and Julius Leber, have formed specifically around this cause. But many in all factions of the party are calling for action.

- @not_a_big_deal: The Nazis' moment will pass. Let's not get too hasty.
- @major_crisis: We must do something to confront the Nazis.
- @antifaschistische_aktion: Form the Antifaschistische Aktion! 
- @easy_discard


@not_a_big_deal
on-arrival: nazi_urgency -= 1; right_dissent += 5

The Nazis are just another far-right movement that will die of its own contradictions sooner or later; we do not need to build a specific policy to combat them.

@major_crisis
view-if: nazi_urgency < 5
on-arrival: nazi_urgency += 1;

The Nazis are one of the foremost threats to the German Left. However, we are still formulating a strategy to confront them, and still trying to build up consensus within our party for action. Check back on this later.

@iron_front
title: Form the Antifaschistische Aktion!
subtitle: The Antifaschistische Aktion consists of the KPD, the RFB, and other leftist groups.
view-if: nazi_urgency >= 2 and iron_front_formed == 1
on-arrival: antifaschistische_aktion_formed = 1; radicalization += 1; nazi_urgency += 1; workers_kpd += 5*(1-dissent); right_dissent -= 8
achievement: antifaschistische_aktion

The Nazi threat can no longer be ignored. We must build a new organization to confront them - the Antifaschistische Aktion - consisting of the SPD, the ADGB trade union federation, and the *RFB*. The Iron Front has given a new energy to our party.

